• INTENDED USERS OF THE SOFTWARE
kudos-dotnet-agent is a software development kit (SDK) for embedding an AI coding agent into .NET applications. The Software provides an agent loop built on Microsoft Agent Framework, coding tools (script execution, file editing and search), skills, MCP (Model Context Protocol) integration, approval of destructive operations, session recording and resume, in-process local models (LLaMASharp) and remote model integration (Anthropic, OpenAI, Azure OpenAI, Amazon Bedrock, Google Gemini).

